0..73 Comment "//! This source types `Path.step` and `Path.ap` inside another path type."
74..77 Comment "//!"
78..148 Comment "//! Their operand types determine the type of the composite or action."
149..190 Comment "//! A wrapper can hide this operand type."
191..194 Comment "//!"
195..267 Comment "//! The checker reads each operand type before it checks the outer path."
268..315 Comment "//! The kernel replays the resulting composite."
316..319 Comment "//!"
320..376 Comment "//! - see: #3772 — `Path.step` and `Path.ap` in a type"
